Given: p/q = (x + 3)/(x – 3)

So, p = [(x + 3)q]/(x – 3)

To find: (p² + q²)/(p² – q²)

Substituting the value of p in above expression

⇒ {[(x + 3)²q²]/(x – 3)² + q²}/{[(x + 3)²q²]/(x – 3)² – q²}

⇒ q²{(x + 3)²/(x – 3)² + 1}/q²{[(x + 3)²]/(x – 3)² – 1}

⇒ {(x + 3)²/(x – 3)² + 1}/{(x + 3)²/(x – 3)² – 1}

⇒ {(x + 3)² + (x – 3)²}/{(x + 3)² - (x – 3)²}

⇒ {2x² + 18}/12x

⇒ (x² + 9)/6x

∴ the correct option is 4
